cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its evaluation data, please cite it."
title: "ALEXANDRIA: a fully-offline retrieval-augmented assistant on a Raspberry Pi 5"
abstract: >-
  A fully-offline retrieval-augmented assistant running Qwen3-1.7B (Q4_K_M)
  on a Raspberry Pi 5, CPU-only, searching 41 ZIM archives at query time
  alongside a 2,028,337-passage index. This repository contains the frozen
  system as evaluated, a nine-gate verification suite, an installer, and the
  complete per-query evaluation records.
